[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2899602653","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106698#issuecomment-2899602653","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106698","id":2899602653,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6s1Gzd","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-22T00:53:18Z","updated_at":"2025-05-22T00:56:44Z","body":"This is expected, as the lightmap size hint is calculated in real-time according to the primitive meshes texel size project setting. Therefore, any manual changes made to Lightmap Size Hint will be lost when the mesh is updated (which causes its UV2 to be regenerated) or the scene is reloaded.\n\nYou can change what determines the lightmap size hint for all PrimitiveMeshes by adjusting the `rendering/lightmapping/primitive_meshes/texel_size` project setting (lower values are *more* detailed). To change the luxel density for a single PrimitiveMesh, adjust **Lightmap Scale** on the MeshInstance3D node (lower values are *less* detailed).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"u